stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Ready to begin
  s1: Required check running
  s2: Wrong check requested
  s3: Source or environment changed
  s4: No matching running check
  s5: Output was not verified
  s6: More checks remain
  s7: Check failed or was interrupted
  s8: All required checks passed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: start the next required check
  s0 --> s2: request a different check
  s0 --> s3: source changes during a check or source or environment changes or source changes before a check
  s0 --> s4: retained output fails verification or check cannot start or check fails or check exits successfully or check is interrupted or receive another check result
  s1 --> s4: receive another check result
  s1 --> s5: retained output fails verification
  s1 --> s2: start the next required check or request a different check
  s1 --> s3: source changes during a check or source or environment changes or source changes before a check
  s1 --> s6: check exits successfully
  s1 --> s7: check cannot start or check fails or check is interrupted
  s6 --> s1: start the next required check
  s6 --> s2: request a different check
  s6 --> s3: source changes during a check or source or environment changes or source changes before a check
  s6 --> s4: retained output fails verification or check cannot start or check fails or check exits successfully or check is interrupted or receive another check result
  s1 --> s8: check exits successfully
  s8 --> s2: start the next required check or request a different check
  s8 --> s3: source changes during a check or source or environment changes or source changes before a check
  s8 --> s4: retained output fails verification or check cannot start or check fails or check exits successfully or check is interrupted or receive another check result
